# P114 on macOS, AppKit and GtkBackend: Option+Left with the caret in a text field belongs to the field (one word left), never to Back. GtkBackend takes Option+Left as Back elsewhere, so this checks that the field gets it first; AppKit does not use Option+Left for Back and is the control.
# Pass: replayed; the log shows depths 1 2 3, then note: "ab xcd" -- and no depth 2 after the 3.
# P114 在 macOS 上(AppKit 與 GtkBackend):插入點在文字框內時,Option+Left 屬於文字框(往左一個字),永遠不是返回。GtkBackend 在別處把 Option+Left 當成返回，本檔檢查文字框先拿到它;AppKit 不用 Option+Left 返回，作為對照。通過條件見上方英文。
sleep,,,,,,1500000,let P114 settle,macos
taplabel,,,,,Open Fruits,,push Fruits (depth 1),macos
